(text "HassleFree FF-1 | Low-speed controls + supply supervisor" (at 27.94 21.59 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6ccf9e48-2eb5-5cdb-87f6-0623a5614002"))
(text "REQUIREMENTS\n- Schmitt-capable 3.3 V host inputs; software debounce >= 10 ms.\n- RESET_N is a local supply flag, not a validated Zynq POR circuit.\n- Separate bench buttons emulate half/full press, not a two-stage shutter.\n- No sensor connection, no SLVS-EC, no battery path or ESD qualification." (at 134.62 151.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "76256325-6cb1-568b-9494-bbe438f779d3"))
(embedded_fonts no))
